    "body": "The problem with this approach is that I basically need to copy the entire default value into my config, and make the one single change that I care about, in order to remove the \"line_break\" before \"jobs\", or move \"time\" module to before that. That doesn't sound very \"optimal\", as then my local config will be fixed in time, and will never take into consideration additions/removals of modules, or changes in the default order, unless I keep tracking the changes in GitHub.",
