    "created_at": "2020-09-16T18:21:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-16T18:21:06Z",
    "body": "> in order to remove the \"line_break\" before \"jobs\"\r\n\r\nThe suggested way to disable `line_break` or any individual modules is to use the `disabled` property for the reasons you described:\r\n```toml\r\n[line_break]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs for the positioning of the `time` module in the prompt, I'd rather we find a solution that better facilitates reordering the prompt instead of making a breaking change to the prompt order. I agree that `prompt_order`, as it works today, isn't perfect, so I'm definitely open to proposed solutions.",
