    "created_at": "2021-10-18T19:19:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-18T19:19:33Z",
    "body": "I agree that it would be nice to have some relative ordering as things grow - but there are some conveniences that I don't see mentioned here which would address this immediate issue - if you only want to move one module to the beginning or something all you need is\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"$time$all\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nif you want to just move something to before the line break you can just add just stuff around line break:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"$all$time$line_break$jobs$battery$status$shell$character\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nand also you wont miss new modules because they'll be included in `$all`",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
